<h2>10. Variáveis de Ambiente (.env — nunca commitar)</h2>

<span class="codeblock">EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://cvyissbkfwphtmvvcvop.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=...
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=...
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=...
EXPO_PUBLIC_GROQ_API_KEY=...</span>

<p><code>EXPO_PUBLIC_*</code> são inlined pelo Metro em build time. Secrets de backend nunca devem usar este prefixo.</p>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<h2>11. Comandos Principais</h2>

<table>
  <tr><th>Comando</th><th>Uso</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm start</code></td><td>Metro Bundler (dev)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run android</code></td><td>Rodar no Android (emulador ou dispositivo)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npx tsc --noEmit</code></td><td>Type-check — rodar antes de qualquer commit importante</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm install &lt;pkg&gt; --legacy-peer-deps</code></td><td>Instalar dependências</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run build:android</code></td><td>APK release (via build.ps1)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run build:android:debug</code></td><td>APK debug</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run prebuild</code></td><td>Regenerar android/ ios/ — DESTRUTIVO</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npx supabase functions deploy &lt;nome&gt; --project-ref cvyissbkfwphtmvvcvop</code></td><td>Deploy de Edge Function</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>git push origin master:main</code></td><td>Push padrão (branch local: master → remoto: main)</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Build de Release (build.ps1)</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Commit assets + app.json e push</li>
  <li>Para processos Gradle</li>
  <li>Deleta pasta <code>android/</code></li>
  <li><code>npx expo prebuild --clean --no-install</code></li>
  <li><code>.\gradlew assembleRelease</code></li>
  <li>Copia APK como <code>SnapGestao-v{version}-build{versionCode}.apk</code></li>
</ol>
<p>Versão atual: <strong>1.0.8 (build 9)</strong> — incrementar em <code>app.json</code> antes do próximo build.</p>

